    "Click GO TO THE GATE; hold W until real player speed exceeds 3 m/s with nonzero throttle and AI disabled.",
    "Release W, then press G to explicitly enable the built-in AI demonstration.",
    "Observe signed wrap-aware course progress, persisted qualifying airtime, actual touchdown telemetry and presentation-time advancement.",
    "Capture chase; press C, verify cockpit mode and capture onboard.",
    "Press Escape, verify the acknowledged worker pause and held tick, and capture pause.",
    "Click RETURN TO PADDOCK and verify menu/presentation clocks reset before proceeding."
  ],
